ue","mechanicId":"action-stat-modifier","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"sourceType":"stat_modifier","target":null,"trigger":null}],"baseType":"passive","characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","energy":null,"iconUrl":"https://assets.marvelstrikeforce.com/imgs/ICON_ABILITY_GREENGOBLINGLIDER_PASSIVE_973dedee.png","id":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","isEmpowered":false,"maxLevel":"6","mechanicsStatus":"available","mentions":[{"abilityId":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"Il est impossible d'appliquer Blocage de capacité et Vulnérable à soi ou aux alliés Sinister Six.","id":"txt_519663dedf800711","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"vulnerable","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"Vulnérable","trigger":null},{"abilityId":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"Obtient +40 % de chance de contre-attaque à soi et aux alliés Sinister Six.","id":"txt_78ba603d49605008","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"counter","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"Contre-attaque","trigger":null},{"abilityId":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","abilityType":"passive","chance":null,"characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","conditions":[],"evidence":"official_text_only","excerpt":"Il est impossible d'appliquer Blocage de capacité et Vulnérable à soi ou aux alliés Sinister Six.","id":"txt_8eccdc3cbd405ddf","kind":"mention","kindLabel":"Mentions","mechanicId":"ability-block","metrics":[],"modes":[],"sides":[],"target":null,"term":"Blocage de capacité","trigger":null}],"name":"Osborn véritable","officialText":"À l'apparition :\n> Donne 3 fois Chargé, jusqu'à un maximum de 5.\n> Dans l'Épreuve, remplit la jauge de vitesse de 9 % par allié Superior Six.\n> En attaque de l'Épreuve, donne Défense augmentée pendant 2 tours à soi et aux alliés Superior Six.\n\nAvec Chargé :\n> Réduit les dégâts de tous les ennemis de 15 %.\n> Réduit la résistance de tous les ennemis de 200 %.\n> Il est impossible d'appliquer Blocage de capacité et Vulnérable à soi ou aux alliés Sinister Six.\n> Obtient +40 % de chance de contre-attaque à soi et aux alliés Sinister Six.\n\nÀ la fin du tour d'un ennemi, avec Chargé :\n> L'attaque ainsi que les cibles adjacentes et inflige 200 % de dégâts.\n> Applique Défense réduite et convertit Vitesse augmentée et 2 autres effets bénéfiques sur ces cibles.\n> Retire1 fois Chargé.\n\nDonne +20 % de vie max.\nApplique +20 % de vie max. aux alliés Sinister Six.","operations":[{"abilityId":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":1,"chance":100,"characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","conditions":[],"effect":{"label":"Défense réduite","mechanicId":"defense-down","resolved":true,"sourceName":"DefenseDown"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_6260b622679f503f","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["defense-down"],"metrics":[{"key":"chancePct","label":"Chance","unit":"%","value":100},{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":1}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":null,"trigger":"À la fin d’un tour"},{"abilityId":"abl_2db31e72e4890cd6","abilityType":"passive","actionOrder":2,"chance":100,"characterId":"GreenGoblinGlider","conditions":["Contexte : Attaque"],"effect":{"label":"Défense augmentée","mechanicId":"defense-up","resolved":true,"sourceName":"DefenseUp"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_1077e4a30e40f35a","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["defense-up"],"metrics":[{"key":"chancePct","label":"Chance","unit":"%","value":100},{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":2}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":["Attaque"],"sourceType":"proc","target":"allié · cible aléatoire · jusqu’à 10","trigger":"Au début du combat"},{"ab